,"tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取frame-sampling技能的工作流说明","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_6e47bbcd1c0f437db4c4ff55","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":19722,"output_tokens":87,"total_tokens":19809,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":25}}},{"content":"---\nname: frame-sampling\ndescription: Sample structured frames from an existing video file. Use when Codex has video_path, file_path, raw_segment_uri, camera_id, sampling_strategy, capture_seconds, or provided frame records and needs stable Frame schema outputs. This skill exposes OpenCV-backed real video frame extraction.\n---\n\n# Frame Sampling\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf the user provides a video file instead of `frames`, do not ask the user to provide frames and do not write custom OpenCV extraction code. Call this skill directly with `camera_id`, `video_path`/`file_path`/`raw_segment_uri`, `capture_seconds`, and `sampling_strategy`. Use `sampling_strategy.mode=interval` and `interval_seconds=1` as the default unless the user requests a different cadence.\n\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\nRun this skill directly with its own script. The script does not call other skill scripts and does not depend on shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n```bash\npython frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video <video.mp4> --camera-id <camera_id> --capture-seconds 10 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir <run_dir> --config <config.json> --output <frames.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--video`, `--frames-json`, `--camera-id`, `--capture-seconds`, `--interval-seconds`, `--fps`, `--output-dir`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read camera id, local video path, and sampling strategy.\n2. Support interval, fps, keyframe, and adaptive strategies when available.\n3. Generate stable frame ids from camera id, timestamp, and sequence.\n4. Store sampled images and return Frame schema records.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. The script contains the executable logic for this skill and must not import shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n## Inputs\n\nRequired:\n- `camera_id`\n\nCommon fields:\n- `raw_segment_uri`\n- `video_path` or `file_path`\n- `started_at`\n- `capture_seconds`\n- `sampling_strategy.mode`: `interval` or `fps`\n- `sampling_strategy.interval_seconds`\n- `sampling_strategy.fps`\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `frames`, each with `frame_id`, `camera_id`, `timestamp`, `image_uri`, `width`, `height`, `sequence`, and for real video `source_elapsed_seconds`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `MISSING_CAMERA_ID`\n- `VIDEO_OPEN_FAILED`\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not run detection, tracking, event recognition, or evidence annotation.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"6b5ddc09-ab70-4c4c-964b-2700b4cb851a","tool_call_id":"call_6e47bbcd1c0f437db4c4ff55","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"好的，我现在将使用frame-sampling技能从全时段均匀采样帧，然后进行事件分析。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":351,"prompt_tokens":20411,"total_tokens":20762,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":198,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":351},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":20411}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-a2ce071b-a8ea-9d8c-8657-34bbb5adeed5","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9dba-250b-7ee2-a2ed-04db009faaef-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"invoke_skill","args":{"input_envelope":"{\"camera_id\": \"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\", \"capture_seconds\": 900, \"interval_seconds\": 60, \"output_dir\": \"/tmp/frame_samples\", \"sampling_strategy\": {\"interval_seconds\": 60, \"mode\": \"interval\"}, \"video_path\": \"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\"}","skill_name":"frame-sampling","mode":"prepare"},"id":"call_7bb4e91fdd0e42cc95bdc4e8","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":20411,"output_tokens":351,"total_tokens":20762,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":198}}}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"我上传了一段路口监控，请检查画面质量，判断有没有事故、拥堵或其他异常，并给出时间线和证据。","normalized_query":"我上传了一段路口监控，请检查画面质量，判断有没有事故、拥堵或其他异常，并给出时间线和证据。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我需要检查上传的路口监控视频画面质量，判断是否存在事故、拥堵或其他异常，并输出对应的时间线与证据","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"路口监控","监控目标":"画面质量、事故、拥堵、其他异常","输出形式":"时间线和证据"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_ab4ae9","text":"我上传了一段路口监控，请检查画面质量，判断有没有事故、拥堵或其他异常，并给出时间线和证据。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_27d367","text":"解析上传的路口监控视频文件，获取编码参数、分辨率、帧率与时间轴信息，按业务采样策略抽取代表性帧序列，输出结构化视频元数据与预处理样本库。"},{"task_span_id":"span_52ddd8","text":"运用图像质量评估算法对预处理帧进行客观测算，依据清晰度指数、信噪比、曝光均衡度与镜头遮挡率设定合格阈值，输出分段时间的画面质量评分表与不可用区间标记。"},{"task_span_id":"span_847ff5","text":"针对达标帧序列加载交通场景理解模型，通过车辆计数与排队长度统计判定拥堵等级，利用轨迹冲突检测与长时间静止规则识别交通事故，并结合预设异常特征库筛查其他违规行为或环境异常，输出带时间戳与置信度的候选事件集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_d139b1","text":"基于候选事件集执行时序逻辑校验，剔除与画面质量不合格区间重叠的无效结果，按时间正序排列构建完整时间线，并关联截取对应的高清证据帧或短片段，输出可追溯的证据索引映射表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_725273","text":"汇总质量诊断结论、异常事件明细与证据映射关系，生成标准化分析报告，明确标注各时间段的路况状态、异常类型判定依据、证据访问路径及分析盲区说明。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_dedf10","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我需要检查上传的路口监控视频画面质量，判断是否存在事故、拥堵或其他异常，并输出对应的时间线与证据。","params":{"视频对象":"路口监控","监控目标":"画面质量、事故、拥堵、其他异常","输出形式":"时间线和证据"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_dedf10","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我需要检查上传的路口监控视频画面质量，判断是否存在事故、拥堵或其他异常，并输出对应的时间线与证据。","params":{"视频对象":"路口监控","监控目标":"画面质量、事故、拥堵、其他异常","输出形式":"时间线和证据"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:44f82758-b13b-4396-910c-6b8967b8812b"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n我上传了一段路口监控，请检查画面质量，判断有没有事故、拥堵或其他异常，并给出时间线和证据。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n我上传了一段路口监控，请检查画面质量，判断有没有事故、拥堵或其他异常，并给出时间线和证据。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-u